# The framework's per-project directory holds runtime state (progress ledger,
# worktrees, role-run logs, notes) beside the tracked configuration files and
# the known-failures file QA's environment rulings are committed to. This repo
# dogfoods the framework, so its own profile, config and known failures are
# tracked.
.delivery-team/*
!.delivery-team/profile.md
!.delivery-team/config.toml
!.delivery-team/known-failures.txt

# Python tooling caches
__pycache__/
.venv/
.pytest_cache/
.mypy_cache/
.ruff_cache/
